---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Deployments"
  description="A reserved section for real GoliathApp and GoliathOmics deployment examples. None are published yet."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Examples</p>
      <h1>Deployments</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        This section will document real GoliathApp and GoliathOmics deployments. None are published yet.
      </p>
      <p>
        The first example reserved here is the current GoliathOmics test setup. A write-up of that setup
        will cover remote workers, the gateway, the database, and long-term storage. Hosts, versions, and
        topology are not listed until that example is written.
      </p>
      <dl class="fields">
        <div>
          <dt>Remote workers</dt>
          <dd>Not published</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Gateway</dt>
          <dd>Not published</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Database</dt>
          <dd>Not published</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Long-term storage</dt>
          <dd>Not published</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
